{"sha":"af3507a68ebe4dd85326e98e2eaa9d0cf62b10f0","node_id":"C_kwDOT54ROtoAKGFmMzUwN2E2OGViZTRkZDg1MzI2ZTk4ZTJlYWE5ZDBjZjYyYjEwZjA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/njedu2023-prog/DC20/git/commits/af3507a68ebe4dd85326e98e2eaa9d0cf62b10f0","html_url":"https://github.com/njedu2023-prog/DC20/commit/af3507a68ebe4dd85326e98e2eaa9d0cf62b10f0","author":{"name":"njedu2023-prog","email":"njedu2023@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-10T13:43:18Z"},"committer":{"name":"njedu2023-prog","email":"njedu2023@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-10T13:43:18Z"},"tree":{"sha":"f8f5ac02c4c73c42dc0687bb754bc05836ff507f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/njedu2023-prog/DC20/git/trees/f8f5ac02c4c73c42dc0687bb754bc05836ff507f"},"message":"audit: preserve historical proofs across reviewed suspension pin repair\n\nAdd hash-bound exact inverse evidence for the November 10 disclosure and pin commits. Historical audit readers verify current bytes before reconstructing their unchanged predecessor view; old reviews and original P0 artifacts remain byte-identical. Synchronize only the current manifest inventory digest. Add mutation rejection tests and run the audit chain in cleanup acceptance.\n\nValidate 48 audit tests, 378 delivery checks, and frozen runtime. No runtime profile admission or candidate freeze changes.","parents":[{"sha":"66bd8082306ec7c535fcea8b5574f0ac17504219","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/njedu2023-prog/DC20/git/commits/66bd8082306ec7c535fcea8b5574f0ac17504219","html_url":"https://github.com/njedu2023-prog/DC20/commit/66bd8082306ec7c535fcea8b5574f0ac17504219"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}}